{"seq":2,"slug":"rollback-recovery-strategy","title":"回滚与恢复策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations/rollback-recovery-strategy","wordCount":1380,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"回滚与恢复策略\">回滚与恢复策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>回滚是发布失败时的安全网——将生产环境恢复到已知良好状态。策略选择取决于部署模式：Blue-Green 秒级流量切回，Canary 停止灰度回退路由，Rolling Update 触发反向滚动。数据库 schema 变更是回滚最复杂的场景，推荐 Expand-Contract 模式使应用层回滚不依赖 schema 回滚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回滚是发布工程的安全网\">回滚是发布工程的安全网</h2><p>每次发布都携带风险——无论质量门多严格，生产环境的复杂性都可能暴露在测试中未发现的问题。回滚策略回答的核心问题是：<strong>当新版本在生产环境中表现异常时，如何以最小的用户影响恢复到已知良好状态？</strong></p>\n<p>回滚的设计原则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>MTTR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>检测时间</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>决策时间</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>执行时间</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>验证时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{MTTR} = \\text{检测时间} + \\text{决策时间} + \\text{执行时间} + \\text{验证时间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MTTR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">检测时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">决策时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">执行时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">验证时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>好的回滚策略将后三个组成部分压缩到最小——理想情况下，检测到问题后数分钟内即可完成回滚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回滚策略的选择矩阵\">回滚策略的选择矩阵</h2><p>不同的部署架构决定了可用的回滚机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部署模式</th>\n<th>回滚机制</th>\n<th>执行时间</th>\n<th>数据风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Blue-Green</td>\n<td>流量切回 Blue</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无状态服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Canary</td>\n<td>停止灰度，回退路由</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>渐进式发布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rolling Update</td>\n<td>触发新一轮滚动（回退版本）</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Kubernetes 默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Immutable Infra</td>\n<td>销毁新实例，路由回旧实例</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>云原生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库迁移</td>\n<td>Forward-fix 或 反向迁移</td>\n<td>高变异</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>有 schema 变更时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动应用</td>\n<td>强制更新到修复版本</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>App Store 审核周期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"blue-green-回滚流程\">Blue-Green 回滚流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 正常发布&#10;        LB1[Load Balancer] --&gt;|100%| G[Green v2.0]&#10;        B[Blue v1.9]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 检测异常&#10;        LB2[Load Balancer] --&gt;|发现问题| G2[Green v2.0]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 回滚完成&#10;        LB3[Load Balancer] --&gt;|100%| B3[Blue v1.9]&#10;        G3[Green v2.0 隔离排查]&#10;    end&#10;    正常发布 --&gt; 检测异常&#10;    检测异常 --&gt; 回滚完成\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 正常发布\n        LB1[Load Balancer] --&gt;|100%| G[Green v2.0]\n        B[Blue v1.9]\n    end\n    subgraph 检测异常\n        LB2[Load Balancer] --&gt;|发现问题| G2[Green v2.0]\n    end\n    subgraph 回滚完成\n        LB3[Load Balancer] --&gt;|100%| B3[Blue v1.9]\n        G3[Green v2.0 隔离排查]\n    end\n    正常发布 --&gt; 检测异常\n    检测异常 --&gt; 回滚完成</pre><p>Blue-Green 的回滚是最快的——只需切换负载均衡器的目标组，不涉及任何实例操作。代价是始终维护两倍的基础设施资源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kubernetes-中的回滚实践\">Kubernetes 中的回滚实践</h2><p>Kubernetes 内建了声明式的版本回滚能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl rollout undo deployment/myapp              # 回退到上一版本&#10;kubectl rollout undo deployment/myapp --to-revision=3  # 回退到指定版本&#10;kubectl rollout status deployment/myapp            # 监控回滚进度\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> undo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/myapp</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              # 回退到上一版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> undo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/myapp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --to-revision=3</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 回退到指定版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment/myapp</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # 监控回滚进度</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Kubernetes 维护 Deployment 的版本历史（默认保留 10 个 revision）。每个 revision 对应一个 ReplicaSet，包含了完整的 Pod spec 快照。</p>\n<h3 id=\"自动回滚\">自动回滚</h3><p>结合 Prometheus 告警和 Argo Rollouts，可以实现指标驱动的自动回滚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>阈值</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错误率 (5xx)</td>\n<td>&gt; 1% 持续 5min</td>\n<td>自动回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟 P99</td>\n<td>&gt; 基线 200% 持续 5min</td>\n<td>自动回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存使用</td>\n<td>&gt; 容器 limit 90%</td>\n<td>触发告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pod 重启次数</td>\n<td>&gt; 3 次/5min</td>\n<td>自动回滚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Argo Rollouts 的 Analysis 资源定义了回滚的判定逻辑——当 Canary 阶段的指标不满足 SuccessCondition 时，自动触发回滚并通知 on-call 团队。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据库变更的回滚难题\">数据库变更的回滚难题</h2><p>数据库 schema 变更是回滚中最复杂的场景——因为数据变更通常不可逆：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Schema 变更类型] --&gt; B{可逆吗？}&#10;    B --&gt;|可逆| C[加列/加索引]&#10;    B --&gt;|不可逆| D[删列/改类型/数据迁移]&#10;    C --&gt; E[反向迁移脚本]&#10;    D --&gt; F{数据丢失可接受？}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[Forward-fix 新迁移]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[必须从备份恢复]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Schema 变更类型] --&gt; B{可逆吗？}\n    B --&gt;|可逆| C[加列/加索引]\n    B --&gt;|不可逆| D[删列/改类型/数据迁移]\n    C --&gt; E[反向迁移脚本]\n    D --&gt; F{数据丢失可接受？}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[Forward-fix 新迁移]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[必须从备份恢复]</pre><p>安全的数据库变更策略（Expand-Contract Pattern）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Expand</strong>：添加新列/表，保持旧结构不变</li>\n<li><strong>Migrate</strong>：后台将数据从旧结构复制到新结构</li>\n<li><strong>切换</strong>：应用层开始使用新结构</li>\n<li><strong>Contract</strong>：确认无问题后，删除旧结构</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键原则：<strong>应用层的回滚不应依赖数据库的回滚</strong>。如果应用 v2.0 需要新列 <code>email_verified</code>，那么 v1.9 也应该能正常工作（忽略该列）——否则应用回滚会因为 schema 不兼容而失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回滚决策框架\">回滚决策框架</h2><p>收到生产告警后的决策流程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>决策</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>回滚</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mrow><mtext>问题明确 </mtext><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\wedge</mtext></mstyle><mtext>上一版本无此问题 </mtext><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\wedge</mtext></mstyle><mtext>无数据迁移</mtext></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Forward-fix</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mrow><mtext>修复简单 </mtext><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\wedge</mtext></mstyle><mtext>回滚有数据风险</mtext></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>特性关闭</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mrow><mtext>问题由新功能引入 </mtext><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\wedge</mtext></mstyle><mtext>有 feature flag</mtext></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>降级</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mrow><mtext>非核心功能 </mtext><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\wedge</mtext></mstyle><mtext>可独立隔离</mtext></mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{决策} = \\begin{cases} \\text{回滚} &amp; \\text{if } \\text{问题明确 \\wedge 上一版本无此问题 \\wedge 无数据迁移} \\\\ \\text{Forward-fix} &amp; \\text{if } \\text{修复简单 \\wedge 回滚有数据风险} \\\\ \\text{特性关闭} &amp; \\text{if } \\text{问题由新功能引入 \\wedge 有 feature flag} \\\\ \\text{降级} &amp; \\text{if } \\text{非核心功能 \\wedge 可独立隔离} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">决策</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:5.76em;vertical-align:-2.63em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.95em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.592em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.916em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.916em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 916\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V916 H384z M384 0 H504 V916 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.45em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回滚</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Forward-fix</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">特性关闭</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">降级</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">问题明确</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\wedge</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上一版本无此问题</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\wedge</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无数据迁移</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">修复简单</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\wedge</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回滚有数据风险</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">问题由新功能引入</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\wedge</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有</span><span class=\"mord\"> feature flag</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">非核心功能</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\wedge</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可独立隔离</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>MTTR</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>回滚</td>\n<td>分钟</td>\n<td>低（无数据变更时）</td>\n<td>首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feature Flag 关闭</td>\n<td>秒</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>有开关的新功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Forward-fix</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n<td>中（新代码可能引入新问题）</td>\n<td>修复很小时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级（Graceful Degradation）</td>\n<td>秒</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>非核心依赖故障</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从备份恢复</td>\n<td>小时~天</td>\n<td>高（数据丢失窗口）</td>\n<td>最后手段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"回滚的组织准备\">回滚的组织准备</h2><p>技术回滚能力只是一半——组织层面的准备同样关键：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>准备项</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>责任人</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Runbook</td>\n<td>每种服务的回滚步骤文档</td>\n<td>开发团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>On-call 轮值</td>\n<td>7x24 有人能执行回滚</td>\n<td>SRE/DevOps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚演练</td>\n<td>每季度模拟回滚（Chaos Engineering）</td>\n<td>全团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信模板</td>\n<td>面向用户的状态页更新模板</td>\n<td>沟通团队</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事后复盘</td>\n<td>Blameless Postmortem 模板</td>\n<td>工程管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"回滚演练的价值\">回滚演练的价值</h3><p>从未被测试的回滚方案在真正需要时大概率会失败——过期的 Runbook、权限不足、依赖已变更。定期演练暴露这些问题，确保回滚路径始终可用。</p>\n<p><a href=\"../release-process/hotfix-emergency-release\">热修复与紧急发布</a>处理的是回滚无法解决的场景（回滚会丢失重要修复），而回滚的触发条件和频率是<a href=\"release-metrics-health\">发布度量与健康指标</a>追踪的关键信号。<a href=\"release-governance-approval\">发布治理</a>中的审批流程则确保回滚决策有明确的授权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MTTR = 检测时间 + 决策时间 + 执行时间 + 验证时间——好的回滚策略压缩后三者</li>\n<li>Blue-Green 回滚最快（秒级切换），代价是双倍基础设施资源</li>\n<li>Kubernetes 内建版本历史和 <code>rollout undo</code>，结合 Argo Rollouts 实现指标驱动自动回滚</li>\n<li>数据库变更推荐 Expand-Contract 模式，使应用回滚不依赖 schema 回滚</li>\n<li>回滚决策框架：优先回滚 &gt; Feature Flag 关闭 &gt; Forward-fix &gt; 降级 &gt; 备份恢复</li>\n<li>定期回滚演练确保 Runbook 有效、权限到位、依赖未变更</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"回滚与恢复策略","id":"回滚与恢复策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"回滚是发布工程的安全网","id":"回滚是发布工程的安全网"},{"level":2,"text":"回滚策略的选择矩阵","id":"回滚策略的选择矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"Blue-Green 回滚流程","id":"blue-green-回滚流程"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubernetes 中的回滚实践","id":"kubernetes-中的回滚实践"},{"level":3,"text":"自动回滚","id":"自动回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库变更的回滚难题","id":"数据库变更的回滚难题"},{"level":2,"text":"回滚决策框架","id":"回滚决策框架"},{"level":2,"text":"回滚的组织准备","id":"回滚的组织准备"},{"level":3,"text":"回滚演练的价值","id":"回滚演练的价值"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"发布治理与审批","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations/release-governance-approval"},"next":{"title":"发布度量与健康指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/release-engineering/governance-operations/release-metrics-health"}}